  "description": "<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"618\">This <strong data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"338\">rectangle seagrass basket</strong> is a natural, handwoven storage piece crafted by skilled artisans in Vietnam using sustainable and durable seagrass. With its sturdy rectangular frame, smooth weave, and rustic appearance, it is ideal for organizing home essentials, retail displays, or as a decorative container.</p>\n<p data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"875\">Whether used for holding towels, toys, magazines, or toiletries, this eco-friendly basket blends perfectly with modern, boho, or minimalist interiors. Lightweight yet strong, it offers a functional and stylish solution for both home and commercial spaces.</p>\n<p data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1071\"><strong data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"908\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong> is a trusted <strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"971\">manufacturer, factory, and wholesale exporter</strong>, offering OEM/ODM customization and large-scale supply for retailers, hotels, and brands worldwide.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1076\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1100\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1100\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1429\">\n<li data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1136\">\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1136\">Made from 100% natural seagrass</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1173\">\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1173\">Handwoven by Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1234\">\n<p data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1234\">Strong rectangular shape with optional handles or lining</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1281\">\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1281\">Lightweight, breathable, and biodegradable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1334\">\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1334\">Available in various sizes, weaves, and finishes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1390\">\n<p data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1390\">Perfect for storage, decoration, and retail display</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1429\">\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1429\">Sustainable and ethically produced</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1434\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1463\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1461\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1487\">Each purchase supports:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1741\">\n<li data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1567\">\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1567\"><strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1523\">Vietnamese rural communities</strong>, especially farmers during the off-season</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1645\">\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1645\"><strong data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1608\">Sustainable use of local materials</strong> and traditional weaving techniques</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1700\">\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1700\"><strong data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1674\">Increased export value</strong> through handmade crafts</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1741\">\n<p data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1741\"><strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1741\">Plastic-free, eco-conscious living</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1876\">At <strong data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1777\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong>, we proudly promote Vietnamese culture while supplying the world with authentic handcrafted goods.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1881\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1917\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1915\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"2009\">📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1951\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1954\" />🌐 Website: 